rmScheduler sound fix\n311\t✅ validate.sh [0/4] pbxproj check live and working — 3-day recurring broken-build root cause eliminated\n312\t✅ Theme tokens enforced — zero raw color/font literals in Day 4 code\n313\t✅ Build pass + 16/16 tests pass\n314\t✅ No third-party SDKs added\n315\t⚠️ AlarmRingView Task not cancelled on early `handleWakeUp()` — latent bug, harmless with stub, risky with real AVAudioEngine\n316\t⚠️ `startListening` not marked `throws` — interface will need update when real implementation lands\n317\t⚠️ No `.caf` audio assets — audio playback silently skips on device\n318\t⚠️ AudioRecorder + RecordingView not yet built — parent recording flow untestable\n319\t❌ Nothing truly broken — previous ❌ (pbxproj) is now fixed\n320\t\n321\t### For next (A — Coder)  ← TOMORROW's brief\n322\t\n323\t**Primary task**: Wire real on-device `SpeechRecognizer` with `SFSpeechRecognizer` + `AVAudioEngine`; fix the Task-cancellation gap in `AlarmRingView`; create `AudioRecorder.swift` and a minimal `RecordingView`.\n324\t\n325\t**Specific work items**:\n326\t1. Modify: `SunnyWalker/Services/SpeechRecognizer.swift`\n327\t   - Replace stub body with spec §4 full implementation: `SFSpeechRecognizer(locale: \"zh-TW\")`, `AVAudioEngine`, `requiresOnDeviceRecognition = true`, `shouldReportPartialResults = true`, keyword list `[\"我起床了\",\"好的\",\"知道了\",\"起床囉\"]`\n328\t   - Change `startListening(onMatch:)` to `throws` (or catch `audioEngine.start()` internally and surface as a `@Published var error`)\n329\t   - Acceptance: on a real device (or sim if speech is available), saying \"我起床了\" triggers `onMatch`; console shows matched keyword\n330\t\n331\t2. Modify: `SunnyWalker/Views/Alarm/AlarmRingView.swift`\n332\t   - Store the 5s-delay Task in `@State private var speechTask: Task<Void, Never>?`\n333\t   - In `handleWakeUp()`: call `speechTask?.cancel()` before `audioPlayer.stop()`\n334\t   - Update `startListening` call site to handle `throws` (wrap in `do/catch`, log error)\n33